Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 19:37:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] apple: Prepare an experimental J72 RAM console path

Select the pinned A7 bootstrap explicitly in the board descriptor, verify the host binary and direct Pi USB topology before launch, and preserve the existing palera1n default. Stop the entire bootstrap process group after success as well as failure.

Add a non-probing serial/NCM/SSH console payload and register the inherited J72 DTB for apple-4k builds. Keep installation disabled and native hardware features unqualified until this exact revision is tested.

